      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفُوزٌ</span></b>  (S) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَنْفُوزٌ</span></b>  (K) An antelope <i>that leaps,
